{"title":"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The measures of the interior angles of a quadrilateral are in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f842e334458884464891840f6aa26fd934e0d313.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1:2:3:4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />. Determine the measure in degrees of the smallest interior angle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the measure of the smallest interior angle. Using the ratio, this means that the other angles are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of the interior angles of any quadrilateral is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96bd59024f5cb49b070ca9b0f8906499940c75e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^{\\circ}$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c9d54acb2f1cc5759d39934845a64d35ce850e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2x + 3x + 4x = 360^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"196\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/1/501e737972f38df5aca11b950052509867926431.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10x = 360^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e0007b26a544068feb50fba64bd34abaa0dba32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{360^{\\circ}}{10} = \\boxed{36^{\\circ}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"137\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC\">2020 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 2\">Team Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br